  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Custom made NPK fertiliser blends</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In Egypt, only standard mixes of fertilisers are available. These readymade compounds often do not meet the local soil and crop needs. The project partners want to set up a blending facility in order to better serve the fertiliser market.Kanza Group is a trader of pesticides in Egypt and has recognised this omission in the market. No compound NPK fertilisers are produced in Egypt. These are mainly imported from Europe and are therefore quite expensive. Because of the costs of these fertilisers the market is dominated by counterfeit products. The shortage of good fertilisers has furthermore led to an increase in prices. Another effect of the use of inferior fertilisers is an excess use of some ingredients and deficiency of others.Kanza Group has been planning to start local production of compound &#x2013; custom made &#x2013; fertilisers and through the Match Making Facility of RVO.nl found N.J. Zeeman Diervoeders B.V..N.J. Zeeman Diervoeders B.V. and Kanza Group want to set up a joint venture that will be able to produce a wide range of NPK fertilisers. Soil analysis will show the exact needs after which an exact blend of fertiliser can be produced according to the needs of the farmer.</narrative>
  </description>
